description:
Location: rust/lichen-rpl/src/dodag.rs lines 369-378

The code includes a SECURITY comment explaining the RFC 6550 Section 8.2.2.5 requirement:

// SECURITY: RFC 6550 Section 8.2.2.5 - reject parents with equal or
// higher rank to prevent routing loops. Only accept neighbors with
// strictly lower rank (unless we are unjoined with infinite rank).

This documents the security rationale and cites the specification. Worth defending - security-critical logic should have such annotations.
